{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":3430375,"ns":0,"title":"Circuit extraction","extract":"The electric circuit extraction or simply circuit extraction, also netlist extraction, is the translation of an integrated circuit layout back into the electrical circuit (netlist) it is intended to represent. This extracted circuit is needed for various purposes including circuit simulation, static timing analysis, signal integrity,  power analysis and optimization, and logic to layout comparison.","description":"Process in electronic design automation","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}